# Cricket Ground Background Image

Please place a cricket ground image file here with the name "cricket-ground-bg.jpg"

The image should be:
- High resolution (1920x1080 or larger)
- Showing a cricket field with pitch, boundary, and field markings
- In JPG format for better compression
- Named exactly: cricket-ground-bg.jpg

You can find free cricket ground images on:
- Unsplash.com
- Pexels.com
- Pixabay.com

Search for "cricket ground", "cricket field", or "cricket pitch"